  "description": "<p><b>This validation needs to be performed only on  F3 managed (type \"M\") datastreams   ((ie not inline XML).</b></p>\n\n<p>Compare the F6 checksum (as reported by OCFL)  with the corresponding checksum of the F3 datastream version.  The F3 checksum  will need to be generated from the file on disk.</p>\n\n<p>In addition,  we want to allow users to optionally skip this checksum validating step (as it may be resource/time intensive). </p>",
